          Hold <ph name="KEY_EQUIVALENT">$1<ex>⌘Q</ex></ph> to Quit
        </message>
        <message name="IDS_CONFIRM_TO_QUIT_OPTION" desc="The label of the checkbox preference that enables the confirm-to-quit feature.">
